WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.100
The Social Media Report System

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.900
A brief introduction — and how it works.

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.000
University Communication Office · Universidad de Zamboanga · 2026

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.300
One year of numbers. One manual pipeline.

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.400
Every month, someone exports the posts

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.400
pastes them into a sheet, and repairs the totals by hand.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.200
The headline cell misses 83% of engagement.

8
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.000
Totals are typed, not derived from the data.

9
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.200
One upload. One record. Every report.

10
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.400
Each month's Facebook export is stored once; totals are computed from it.

11
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.900
Dashboard, monthly report and Excel read that one source.

12
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.800
Four steps, once a month.

13
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.200
01 · Upload the monthly CSV: 32 fields, month selector, one click.

14
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.800
02 · Import once. Every post is parsed and computed in one pass, with no re-typing.

15
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.600
03 · Read the dashboard. October totals update from the imported month.

16
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:54.000
04 · Generate the report: PDF-ready, Excel export, same totals.

17
00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.300
One month, one upload.

18
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.600
Every output reads the same numbers.

19
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.400
October 2026: 99 posts, stored once.

20
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.900
3,910,516 views and 45,580 engagements.

21
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.300
The dashboard, report and Excel export come from one stored month.

22
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.200
Adopt the system as the record. Keep Excel as the output.

23
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:18.200
The workbook stays useful. It just stops being the source of truth.

24
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.200
Import October. Reconcile eight totals. Close the month on system.

25
00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.000
Universidad de Zamboanga · Facebook Page · 2026
